          <li><strong>Trailing Indentation Spaces:</strong> Lines containing only spaces (e.g. <code class="text-xs font-mono bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 px-1 py-0.5 rounded text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400">"    "</code>) left behind by code editors or word processor indentations.</li>
