          <li><strong>Carriage Return Artifacts:</strong> Windows CRLF (<code class="text-xs font-mono bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 px-1 py-0.5 rounded text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400">\r\n</code>) vs Unix LF (<code class="text-xs font-mono bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 px-1 py-0.5 rounded text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400">\n</code>) line-ending mismatches where an isolated carriage return lingers.</li>
